  } catch (err) {
    try {
      await client.query("ROLLBACK");
    } catch (rollbackErr) {
      client.release(rollbackErr);
      throw err;
    }
    throw err;
  } finally {
    client.release();
  }
}
```

The `client.release(err)` call removes it from the pool instead of returning it.

