4. The dead client is released back to the pool anyway

And if it drops during COMMIT, the transaction may have partially applied on the server even though the client doesn't know it succeeded.

The function needs error handling that distinguishes between recoverable errors and dead connections, and avoids masking the original failure with a rollback error.

